ra:"With over two decades of operation, Mamuth is a national benchmark in high-pressure solutions. We combine tradition and cutting-edge technology to deliver equipment that ensures maximum performance and absolute safety for your industry's most critical operations.",titleValores:"Our Values",subtitleValores:"The principles that guide our actions and decisions every day.",titleQualidade:"Quality",subtitleQualidade:"Commitment to excellence in all our products and services.",titleInovacao:"Innovation",subtitleInovacao:"Constant search for advanced and efficient technological solutions.",titleConfiabilidade:"Reliability",subtitleConfiabilidade:"A trusted partner for critical industrial operations.",titleSustentabilidade:"Sustainability",subtitleSustentabilidade:"Responsible practices that respect the environment.",titleExcelencia:"Excellence",subtitleExcelencia:"Exceeding expectations in every project and service.",titleMarcas:"Represented Brands",subtitleMarcas:"We carefully select each partner to offer the best to the Brazilian market.",subtitleParker:"Parker Polyflex is a global leader in motion and control technologies, providing essential components for water jetting systems, such as high-pressure hoses, fittings, and valves. Recognized for quality and reliability, the company has a strong presence in Brazil, offering safe and efficient solutions for industrial applications.",subtitleFalch:"Falch is a German manufacturer specializing in water jetting equipment and high-pressure systems for industrial applications. With over 40 years of experience, it develops robust and innovative solutions recognized for efficiency, durability, and high performance in demanding operations.",btnMarcas:"Learn more →",titleTrajetoria:"Our Journey",subtitleTrajetoria:"Decades of growth and innovation in the industrial sector.",subtitle2003:"Foundation",text2003:"Commencement of activities in São Paulo, focusing on providing industrial solutions for high-pressure applications.",subt